      "content": "/* ============================================================\n * ui-modern.css — v4.30.0 High-End UI Overlay (2026 design)\n * Loaded AFTER style.css — upgrades the whole system visually\n * without breaking any existing class names or page markup.\n * 100% self-hosted, no CDN. RTL-first. Fully responsive.\n * ============================================================ */\n\n/* ---------- 1) Design tokens ---------- */\n:root {\n    /* Palette (light, airy, professional) */\n    --primary: #4f46e5;\n    --primary-hover: #4338ca;\n    --primary-soft: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.09);\n    --primary-ring: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.22);\n    --accent: #0ea5e9;\n    --success: #10b981;\n    --warning: #f59e0b;\n    --danger: #ef4444;\n\n    --bg-body: #f4f6fb;\n    --bg-card: #ffffff;\n    --bg-header: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);\n    --text-main: #101828;\n    --text-muted: #667085;\n    --border-color: #e6e9f0;\n    --table-header: #f7f8fc;\n    --table-hover: #f4f6ff;\n    --input-bg: #ffffff;\n\n    /* Elevation — soft colored shadows */\n    --shadow-xs: 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.05);\n    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.07), 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.05);\n    --shadow-md: 0 6px 16px -6px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.12), 0 2px 6px -2px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);\n    --shadow-lg: 0 16px 40px -12px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.18);\n    --shadow-primary: 0 8px 20px -8px var(--primary-ring);\n\n    /* Geometry */\n    --radius-sm: 8px;\n    --radius-md: 12px;\n    --radius-lg: 16px;\n    --radius-xl: 20px;\n\n    /* Motion */\n    --ease: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    --spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n/* Respect user settings from settings.php (header injects --primary via :root inline) */\n\n/* ---------- 2) Base & typography ---------- */\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\nbody {\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.06), transparent 60%),\n        radial-gradient(900px 420px at -10% 110%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.05), transparent 55%),\n        var(--bg-body);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n}\n::selection { background: var(--primary-ring); }\n\n/* Thin modern scrollbars */\n* { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #c7cdda transparent; }\n*::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }\n*::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n*::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #c7cdda; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid transparent; background-clip: content-box; }\n*::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9aa3b5; border: 2px solid transparent; background-clip: content-box; }\n\n/* Page content entrance */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n    main.flex-1 > * { animation: uiFadeUp .35s var(--ease) both; }\n    @keyframes uiFadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 3) Header / navbar — glass ---------- */\nheader.navbar {\n    background: var(--bg-header) !important;\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 50;\n}\nheader.navbar h1 { letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\nheader.navbar img { border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }\n\n/* ---------- 4) Sidebar — v4.37.0 modern nav (no emojis, marker accents) ---------- */\n.sidebar {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #fafbff) !important;\n    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n}\n.sidebar-scroll { padding-inline-end: 6px; }\n\n/* Section titles: small caps-like labels with a soft rule */\n.sidebar-section-title {\n    font-size: 0.64rem !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    color: #98a2b3 !important;\n    border-bottom: none !important;\n    margin: 1.05rem .4rem .35rem !important;\n    padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n    position: relative;\n    opacity: 1;\n}\n.sidebar-section-title::after { content: '▾'; font-size: .6rem; opacity: .7; }\n.sidebar-section-title:first-child { margin-top: .2rem !important; }\n\n/* Items: clean rows with a rounded leading marker dot */\n.sidebar-item {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: .6rem;\n    border-radius: 10px !important;\n    padding: .58rem .7rem .58rem .5rem !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    color: #475467 !important;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    transition: background-color .16s var(--ease), color .16s var(--ease), padding .16s var(--ease) !important;\n}\n.sidebar-item::before {\n    content: '';\n    width: 6px; height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: #cdd5e1;\n    flex: none;\n    transition: background-color .16s var(--ease), transform .16s var(--ease), box-shadow .16s var(--ease);\n}\n.sidebar-item:hover {\n    background: var(--primary-soft) !important;\n    color: var(--primary) !important;\n    transform: none;\n}\n.sidebar-item:hover::before { background: var(--primary); transform: scale(1.25); }\n.sidebar-item.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 72%, #7c3aed)) !important;\n    color: #fff !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary) !important;\n}\n.sidebar-item.active::before {\n    background: #fff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n    transform: scale(1.15);\n}\n\n/* ---------- 5) Cards ---------- */\n.card {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) !important;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm) !important;\n    transition: box-shadow .22s var(--ease), transform .22s var(--ease), border-color .22s var(--ease) !important;\n}\n.card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md) !important; }\n.page-hero {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-soft), rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.07)) !important;\n    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 14%, var(--border-color)) !important;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) !important;\n}\n.soft-panel {\n    background: #f8f9fd !important;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;\n}\n.stats-mini {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 60%, #0ea5e9)) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary) !important;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 6) Buttons — tactile, focus-visible ---------- */\n.btn {\n    border-radius: 10px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n    gap: .4rem;\n    transition: transform .15s var(--spring), box-shadow .18s var(--ease), background-color .18s var(--ease), border-color .18s var(--ease), filter .18s var(--ease) !important;\n    will-change: transform;\n}\n.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }\n.btn:active { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98) !important; }\n.btn:focus-visible { outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--primary-ring) !important; }\n.btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 92%, #fff), var(--primary)) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-primary), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18) !important;\n}\n.btn-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.06); background: var(--primary) !important; }\n.btn-success { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45) !important; }\n.btn-danger { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -8px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45) !important; }\n.btn-warning { box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -8px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45) !important; }\n.btn-outline { border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color) !important; background: var(--bg-card) !important; }\n.btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--primary) !important; color: var(--primary) !important; background: var(--primary-soft) !important; }\n.btn-secondary { background: #eef1f6 !important; color: #344054 !important; box-shadow: none !important; }\n.btn-secondary:hover { background: #e4e8f0 !important; }\n.btn[disabled], .btn.disabled { opacity: .55; pointer-events: none; }\n\n/* ---------- 7) Forms — clear, touch-friendly ---------- */\n.form-input, .form-select, .form-textarea {\n    border-radius: 10px !important;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    background: var(--input-bg) !important;\n    transition: border-color .16s var(--ease), box-shadow .16s var(--ease), background-color .16s var(--ease) !important;\n    min-height: 34px;\n}\n.form-input:hover, .form-select:hover, .form-textarea:hover { border-color: #cdd4e0 !important; }\n.form-input:focus, .form-select:focus, .form-textarea:focus {\n    border-color: var(--primary) !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3.5px var(--primary-ring) !important;\n    background: #fff !important;\n}\n.form-select {\n    appearance: none;\n    -webkit-appearance: none;\n    background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8'><path fill='%23667085' d='M6 8L0 .9.9 0 6 6.1 11.1 0l.9.9z'/></svg>\") !important;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;\n    background-position: left 0.7rem center !important;\n    padding-left: 2rem !important;\n}\nlabel { user-select: none; }\ninput[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] {\n    width: 16px; height: 16px;\n    accent-color: var(--primary);\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\ninput[type=\"file\"].form-input { padding: .5rem !important; cursor: pointer; }\ninput[type=\"file\"]::file-selector-button {\n    border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: .4rem .8rem; margin-inline-end: .6rem;\n    background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background .18s var(--ease);\n    font-family: inherit;\n}\ninput[type=\"file\"]::file-selector-button:hover { background: var(--primary-ring); }\n\n/* ---------- 8) Tables — pro data grid look ---------- */\n.table-container {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);\n    background: var(--bg-card);\n    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;\n}\nth {\n    background: var(--table-header) !important;\n    color: #475467 !important;\n    font-weight: 800 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em !important;\n    text-transform: none !important;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\ntd { color: var(--text-main); }\ntbody tr { transition: background-color .12s var(--ease); }\ntbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fafbfe; }\ntbody tr:hover td { background: var(--table-hover) !important; }\n.table-container thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--border-color); }\n\n/* ---------- 9) Badges — soft pill ---------- */\n.badge { border-radius: 999px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; line-height: 1.4; }\n.badge-success { background: #ecfdf3 !important; color: #067647 !important; border-color: #abefc6 !important; }\n.badge-warning { background: #fffaeb !important; color: #b54708 !important; border-color: #fedf89 !important; }\n.badge-danger  { background: #fef3f2 !important; color: #b42318 !important; border-color: #fecdca !important; }\n.badge-info    { background: #eff8ff !important; color: #175cd3 !important; border-color: #b2ddff !important; }\n\n/* ---------- 10) Wizard steps ---------- */\n.wizard-steps { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs); gap: .35rem; }\n.wizard-step { border-bottom-width: 3px !important; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }\n.wizard-step.active { background: var(--primary-soft); }\n.wizard-step.completed { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.07); }\n\n/* ---------- 11) Modals — blur + spring in ---------- */\n.modal-backdrop {\n    background: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.5) !important;\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n}\n.modal-backdrop[style*=\"flex\"] .modal-card { animation: uiModalIn .28s var(--spring) both; }\n@keyframes uiModalIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px) scale(.97); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n.modal-card { border-radius: var(--radius-lg) !important; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg) !important; }\n\n/* Hover tooltip card */\n.student-hover-tooltip {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg) !important;\n    animation: uiFadeUp .18s var(--ease) both;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 12) Flash messages — toast look ---------- */\n.flash-message {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;\n    border-width: 1px !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md) !important;\n    animation: uiFadeUp .3s var(--ease) both;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 13) User dropdown ---------- */\n.user-menu-dropdown {\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg) !important;\n    animation: uiFadeUp .18s var(--ease) both;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 14) Filters row ---------- */\n.filter-more { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; background: #fafbfe; }\n.filter-more summary { transition: color .15s var(--ease); }\n.filter-more summary:hover { color: var(--primary-hover); }\n\n/* ---------- 15) Integrated hub (iframe tabs) ---------- */\n.integrated-tabs { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; }\n.integrated-hub iframe { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs); }\n\n/* ---------- 16) Avatars ---------- */\n.avatar-lg { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7), var(--shadow-xs); }\n\n/* ---------- 17) Loading states (used by ui-modern.js) ---------- */\n.ui-loading-bar {\n    position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; left: 0; height: 3px; z-index: 9999;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--accent), var(--primary));\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\n    animation: uiLoadingSlide 1s linear infinite;\n    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;\n    transition: opacity .2s var(--ease);\n}\n.ui-loading-bar.on { opacity: 1; }\n@keyframes uiLoadingSlide { from { background-position: 200% 0; } to { background-position: 0 0; } }\n\n.ui-skeleton {\n    position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #eef0f6 !important; color: transparent !important;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n.ui-skeleton::after {\n    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.65), transparent);\n    animation: uiShimmer 1.2s infinite;\n}\n@keyframes uiShimmer { from { transform: translateX(100%); } to { transform: translateX(-100%); } }\n\n/* Button busy spinner */\n.btn.ui-busy { pointer-events: none; opacity: .75; position: relative; }\n.btn.ui-busy::after {\n    content: ''; width: 14px; height: 14px; margin-inline-start: .45rem;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45); border-top-color: #fff; border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: uiSpin .7s linear infinite; display: inline-block; vertical-align: -2px;\n}\n.btn-outline.ui-busy::after, .btn-secondary.ui-busy::after { border-color: rgba(0,0,0,.2); border-top-color: var(--text-main); }\n@keyframes uiSpin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n\n/* ---------- 18) Back-to-top ---------- */\n.ui-backtop {\n    position: fixed; bottom: 18px; left: 18px; z-index: 900;\n    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--primary); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); cursor: pointer; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    transition: transform .18s var(--spring), box-shadow .18s var(--ease);\n}\n.ui-backtop:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }\n.ui-backtop.show { display: flex; }\n\n/* ---------- 19) Responsive refinements ---------- */\n/* Comfortable touch targets on coarse pointers */\n@media (pointer: coarse) {\n    .btn { min-height: 40px; }\n    .form-input, .form-select { min-height: 40px; }\n    .sidebar-item { padding-top: .65rem !important; padding-bottom: .65rem !important; }\n    input[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] { width: 19px; height: 19px; }\n}\n\n/* Tablet */\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .card { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; }\n}\n\n/* v4.34.0: FIX broken mobile menu.\n * style.css has two conflicting rules: an old @media(max-width:768px) block\n * turns the sidebar into a 24vh full-width horizontal strip, fighting the\n * newer @media(max-width:900px) fixed drawer. Below 768px the old rule won\n * (width:100%!important / height:24vh) and the menu rendered as a squashed\n * horizontal bar. These overrides (loaded after style.css) restore a proper\n * full-height slide-in drawer on ALL mobile sizes. */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .sidebar {\n        position: fixed !important;\n        top: 0 !important;\n        right: 0 !important;\n        bottom: 0 !important;\n        width: min(84vw, 320px) !important;\n        height: 100vh !important;\n        height: 100dvh !important;\n        max-height: none !important;\n        z-index: 3000 !important;\n        transform: translateX(105%);\n        transition: transform .28s var(--spring);\n        display: flex !important;\n        flex-direction: column !important;\n        overflow: hidden !important;\n        padding: 1rem !important;\n    }\n    body.sidebar-open .sidebar { transform: translateX(0); }\n    /* vertical scroll inside the drawer — kill the old horizontal strip */\n    .sidebar .sidebar-scroll {\n        display: flex !important;\n        flex-direction: column !important;\n        gap: 2px !important;\n        overflow-y: auto !important;\n        overflow-x: hidden !important;\n        height: 100% !important;\n        align-items: stretch !important;\n        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n        padding-bottom: 2rem;\n    }\n    /* bring back section titles (old rule hid them) */\n    .sidebar .sidebar-section-title {\n        display: flex !important;\n        margin: .8rem .2rem .3rem !important;\n    }\n    .sidebar .sidebar-item {\n        white-space: normal !important;\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: .7rem .8rem !important;\n        font-size: .85rem !important;\n        margin-bottom: 2px !important;\n        flex: none !important;\n    }\n    /* v4.35.0: compact single-line mobile header (≈56px).\n     * The old override (max-height:none) let wrapped items grow the header\n     * to half the screen. Now: one slim row = hamburger | logo+title | user. */\n    header.navbar {\n        display: grid !important;\n        /* v4.67.0: هدر حالا ۲ فرزند دارد — گروه (☰+لوگو+نام) و گروه کاربر */\n        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto !important;\n        align-items: center !important;\n        gap: .5rem !important;\n        height: 56px !important;\n        min-height: 56px !important;\n        max-height: 56px !important;\n        padding: 0 .7rem !important;\n        overflow: visible !important; /* keep the user dropdown visible */\n        flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n    }\n    /* middle group: logo + school name in ONE line */\n    header.navbar > .flex.items-center:first-of-type {\n        min-width: 0 !important;\n        gap: .5rem !important;\n        flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n        overflow: hidden !important;\n    }\n    header.navbar img { height: 32px !important; width: 32px !important; flex: none; }\n    header.navbar h1 {\n        font-size: .95rem !important;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        white-space: nowrap !important;\n        overflow: hidden !important;\n        text-overflow: ellipsis !important;\n        line-height: 1.4 !important;\n    }\n    /* hide the panel-type subtitle under the title */\n    header.navbar h1 + span.text-xs { display: none !important; }\n    /* hide the long date text */\n    header.navbar span.text-sm.font-medium { display: none !important; }\n    /* trailing group: compact icon-only user button */\n    header.navbar > .flex.items-center:last-child {\n        gap: .35rem !important;\n        flex-wrap: nowrap !important;\n        justify-content: flex-end !important;\n    }\n    header.navbar .user-menu-btn {\n        padding: .4rem .55rem !important;\n        font-size: 0 !important;\n        line-height: 1 !important;\n    }\n    header.navbar .user-menu-btn::before { content: '👤'; font-size: 1.05rem; }\n    header.navbar .user-menu-dropdown { position: fixed; top: 60px; left: 8px; right: 8px; width: auto; min-width: 0; }\n    header.navbar .hamburger-btn { padding: .4rem .6rem !important; font-size: 1rem !important; }\n    /* app shell heights follow the 56px header */\n    body > .flex { height: calc(100vh - 56px) !important; height: calc(100dvh - 56px) !important; }\n    main.flex-1 { height: auto !important; min-height: 0 !important; flex: 1 1 auto !important; width: 100% !important; }\n    /* dark overlay closes the drawer on tap (needs pointer events) */\n    body.sidebar-open::after { pointer-events: auto !important; }\n}\n\n/* Mobile — refined drawer + sticky topbar */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .sidebar {\n        border-radius: 0 var(--radius-xl) var(--radius-xl) 0 !important;\n        box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg) !important;\n    }\n    body.sidebar-open::after { -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px); backdrop-filter: blur(2px); background: rgba(16,24,40,.45) !important; }\n    .hamburger-btn { border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs); }\n    .table-container { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; }\n    /* horizontal scroll affordance */\n    .table-container { background:\n        linear-gradient(to left, var(--bg-card) 30%, transparent),\n        linear-gradient(to right, var(--bg-card) 30%, transparent) 100% 0,\n        radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 50%, rgba(16,24,40,.14), transparent),\n        radial-gradient(farthest-side at 0% 50%, rgba(16,24,40,.14), transparent) 100% 0;\n        background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 60px 100%, 60px 100%, 18px 100%, 18px 100%;\n        background-attachment: local, local, scroll, scroll;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .card { padding: .8rem !important; }\n    .modal-card { width: 96vw !important; border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; }\n    .wizard-step { font-size: .7rem !important; padding: .4rem .2rem !important; }\n    .flash-message { font-size: 12px !important; }\n    .page-hero { border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important; }\n    .ui-backtop { bottom: 12px; left: 12px; width: 36px; height: 36px; }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 20) Accessibility & motion ---------- */\n:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }\n.btn:focus-visible, .form-input:focus-visible, .form-select:focus-visible { outline: none; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 21) Auth / Login pages (v4.32.0 — split-screen redesign) ---------- */\nbody.auth-page main.flex-1 {\n    position: relative;\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 110% -20%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 32%, transparent), transparent 55%),\n        radial-gradient(800px 550px at -15% 115%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.28), transparent 55%),\n        linear-gradient(140deg, #0f1330, #171d45 45%, #1b2258);\n    overflow-y: auto !important;\n}\nbody.auth-page main.flex-1::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.10) 1px, transparent 1.4px);\n    background-size: 26px 26px;\n    mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 70% at 50% 40%, #000 0%, transparent 100%);\n    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 70% at 50% 40%, #000 0%, transparent 100%);\n}\n\n.auth-wrap {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n.auth-card {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 40px 90px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n    animation: uiFadeUp .5s var(--ease) both;\n    padding: 0;\n    border: 0;\n}\n\n/* Brand side (right in RTL) */\n.auth-brand {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 2.4rem 1.8rem;\n    color: #fff;\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(420px 300px at 90% -10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.16), transparent 60%),\n        radial-gradient(300px 260px at 0% 110%, rgba(0,0,0,0.25), transparent 60%),\n        linear-gradient(155deg, var(--primary), color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 55%, #7c3aed) 55%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 40%, #0ea5e9));\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.auth-brand::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1.4px);\n    background-size: 22px 22px;\n    opacity: .5;\n}\n.auth-brand > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.auth-logo {\n    width: 76px; height: 76px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n}\n.auth-logo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 20px; }\n.auth-brand-title { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.7; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n.auth-brand-sub { font-size: .74rem; opacity: .85; line-height: 2; }\n.auth-brand-features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; margin-top: .5rem; }\n.auth-feature {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;\n    font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 600;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: .55rem .8rem;\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px); backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n}\n.auth-feature .fi { font-size: 1rem; }\n\n/* Form side */\n.auth-form-side { padding: 2.2rem 2.2rem 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.auth-form-title { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: .2rem; }\n.auth-form-sub { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }\n\n/* Segmented tabs */\n.auth-tabs {\n    display: flex; gap: 4px;\n    background: #eef0f7;\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    padding: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n.auth-tab {\n    flex: 1; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent;\n    padding: .6rem .3rem; border-radius: 10px;\n    font-size: .73rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-family: inherit;\n    transition: background .18s var(--ease), color .18s var(--ease), box-shadow .18s var(--ease), transform .18s var(--ease);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.auth-tab:hover { color: var(--text-main); }\n.auth-tab.active {\n    background: #fff; color: var(--primary);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.12);\n}\n\n/* Fields with leading icon */\n.auth-field { margin-bottom: .95rem; }\n.auth-field > label { display: block; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #475467; margin-bottom: .35rem; }\n.auth-input-wrap { position: relative; }\n.auth-input-wrap .auth-icon {\n    position: absolute; inset-inline-start: .8rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\n    font-size: .95rem; opacity: .5; pointer-events: none;\n}\n.auth-input-wrap .form-input { padding-inline-start: 2.4rem !important; min-height: 44px; font-size: .92rem; border-radius: 12px !important; }\n.auth-input-wrap .form-select { min-height: 44px; border-radius: 12px !important; }\n.auth-input-wrap .auth-eye {\n    position: absolute; inset-inline-end: .5rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\n    border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; opacity: .5;\n    padding: .35rem; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1;\n    transition: opacity .15s var(--ease), background .15s var(--ease);\n}\n.auth-input-wrap .auth-eye:hover { opacity: 1; background: var(--primary-soft); }\n\n/* Captcha box */\n.auth-captcha {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem;\n    background: #f7f8fd;\n    border: 1.5px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 35%, var(--border-color));\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: .65rem .8rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;\n}\n.auth-captcha .auth-captcha-q {\n    font-family: monospace; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--primary);\n    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: .35rem .7rem; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: .05em;\n    user-select: none;\n}\n.auth-captcha .form-input { flex: 1; min-height: 40px; text-align: center; font-family: monospace; }\n.auth-captcha .auth-captcha-label { font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; }\n\n.auth-submit { width: 100%; min-height: 48px; font-size: .95rem !important; font-weight: 800 !important; border-radius: 13px !important; }\n.auth-foot { text-align: center; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.1rem; }\n.auth-foot a { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: color .15s var(--ease); }\n.auth-foot a:hover { color: var(--primary); }\n\n.auth-panel { animation: uiFadeUp .3s var(--ease) both; }\n\n/* Responsive: brand becomes compact header band */\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n    .auth-wrap { max-width: 480px; }\n    .auth-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-radius: 20px; }\n    .auth-brand { padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: .9rem; justify-content: flex-start; }\n    .auth-logo { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .auth-logo img { border-radius: 14px; }\n    .auth-brand-title { font-size: 1rem; }\n    .auth-brand-sub { font-size: .66rem; }\n    .auth-brand-features { display: none; }\n    .auth-form-side { padding: 1.5rem 1.2rem 1.2rem; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .auth-tab { font-size: .66rem; padding: .55rem .15rem; }\n    .auth-captcha { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .auth-card { border-radius: 16px; }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 22) Print unchanged ---------- */\n@media print {\n    .ui-loading-bar, .ui-backtop { display: none !important; }\n    body { background: #fff !important; }\n}\n\n\n/* ---------- 23) v4.37.0 fixes ---------- */\n/* (3) Breathing room at the end of the main scroll area so the footer/last\n * rows are never clipped on desktop & tablet. */\nmain.flex-1 { padding-bottom: 3.5rem !important; scroll-padding-bottom: 3.5rem; }\nmain.flex-1 > :last-child { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n/* keep inner table scroller from eating the page end */\n.table-container { max-height: min(58vh, 580px) !important; }\n@media print { main.flex-1 { padding-bottom: 0 !important; } }\n\n/* (1) Mobile: hide per-row main buttons — everything lives in the ⋮ menu */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .row-act-main { display: none !important; }\n    .row-menu-btn { padding: .5rem .8rem !important; font-size: 1.05rem !important; }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 24) v4.41.0 fixes ---------- */\n/* (a) Sidebar section collapse: must beat `.sidebar-item{display:flex!important}`\n   from section 4, otherwise clicking a section title hides nothing. */\n.sidebar-item.menu-collapsed { display: none !important; }\n.sidebar-section-title { cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }\n.sidebar-section-title::after { transition: transform .2s var(--ease); display: inline-block; }\n.sidebar-section-title.collapsed::after { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n\n/* (b) v4.42.0 — User dropdown: SIMPLE & BULLETPROOF.\n   v4.41.0 moved the desktop dropdown to position:fixed; combined with the\n   navbar's backdrop-filter (which becomes the containing block for fixed\n   descendants) this could break opening entirely on some browsers.\n   Rollback: dropdown stays position:absolute inside .user-menu-wrap exactly\n   like the original design, and we only lift the header stacking order. */\n\n/* Header must sit above ALL page content (hover tooltip = 2000).\n   Kept below the mobile drawer (3000) and modals. */\nheader.navbar {\n    position: relative !important;\n    z-index: 2500 !important;\n    /* backdrop-filter creates containing-block traps for fixed children —\n       remove it; the header background is opaque enough without blur. */\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n    backdrop-filter: none !important;\n    /* v4.43.0 — ROOT CAUSE FIX (found by user):\n       the <header> itself has the `flex` class and is a direct child of\n       <body>, so style.css's `body > .flex { overflow: hidden }` (meant for\n       the layout wrapper) ALSO clips the header — cutting off the dropdown\n       that hangs below the header edge. Only the header is released here;\n       the layout wrapper keeps overflow:hidden so the desktop-app layout\n       (internal pane scrolling) is untouched. */\n    overflow: visible !important;\n}\n.user-menu-wrap { position: relative !important; }\n\n/* Base state — same geometry as the original style.css design */\n.user-menu-dropdown {\n    position: absolute !important;\n    top: calc(100% + 8px) !important;\n    left: 0 !important;\n    right: auto !important;\n    min-width: 220px;\n    z-index: 6000 !important;\n    animation: none !important;      /* no fade tricks — reliability first */\n}\n\n/* OPEN state — guaranteed to win against anything else */\nbody.user-menu-open .user-menu-dropdown {\n    display: flex !important;\n    opacity: 1 !important;\n    visibility: visible !important;\n    transform: none !important;\n    pointer-events: auto !important;\n}\n\n/* Mobile: full-width panel fixed right under the 56px header (as in v4.35) */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    header.navbar .user-menu-dropdown {\n        position: fixed !important;\n        top: 60px !important;\n        left: 8px !important;\n        right: 8px !important;\n        width: auto !important;\n        min-width: 0 !important;\n        z-index: 6000 !important;\n    }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n * v4.66.0 — Collapsible sidebar on DESKTOP & TABLET (all panels,\n * all roles: admin / teacher / student / deputy / counselor…).\n * The same ☰ button that opens the mobile drawer now, above 900px,\n * toggles body.sidebar-collapsed to slide the sidebar away so the\n * user can focus on the page content. State persists (localStorage).\n * ============================================================ */\n@media (min-width: 901px) {\n    /* style.css hides .hamburger-btn on desktop — bring it back as the collapse toggle */\n    header.navbar .hamburger-btn {\n        display: inline-flex !important;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        border-radius: 10px !important;\n        box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);\n        transition: background .15s ease, transform .15s ease;\n    }\n    header.navbar .hamburger-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }\n    body.sidebar-collapsed header.navbar .hamburger-btn { background: var(--primary) !important; color: #fff !important; border-color: var(--primary) !important; }\n\n    .sidebar {\n        transition: width .25s ease, min-width .25s ease, padding .25s ease, opacity .18s ease, border .25s ease;\n    }\n    body.sidebar-collapsed .sidebar {\n        width: 0 !important;\n        min-width: 0 !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        border-left-width: 0 !important;\n        border-right-width: 0 !important;\n        overflow: hidden !important;\n        opacity: 0;\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n}\n\n/* hidden must win over the flex captcha layout, including the very first paint. */\n.auth-captcha[hidden]{display:none!important}\n",
